msgid "How long can data be missing before RRDtool records unknown data.  Increase this value if your Data Source is unstable and you wish to carry forward old data rather than show gaps in your graphs.  This value is multiplied by the X-Files Factor to determine the actual amount of time."
msgstr "Hvor længe data kan mangle, før RRDtool registrerer ukendte data.  Forøg denne værdi, hvis din datakilde er ustabil, og du ønsker at føre gamle data videre i stedet for at vise huller i dine grafer.  Denne værdi ganges med X-Files-faktoren for at bestemme den faktiske tid."

#: include/global_form.php lib/rrd.php
msgid "X-Files Factor"
msgstr "X-Files-faktor"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The amount of unknown data that can still be regarded as known."
msgstr "Mængden af ukendte data, der stadig kan betragtes som kendte."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Consolidation Functions"
msgstr "Konsolideringsfunktioner"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data is to be entered in RRAs."
msgstr "Hvordan data indføres i RRA'er."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Is this the default storage profile?"
msgstr "Er dette standardlagringsprofilen?"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "RRDfile Size (in Bytes)"
msgstr "RRDfile-størrelse (i bytes)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Based upon the number of Rows in all RRAs and the number of Consolidation Functions selected, the size of this entire in the RRDfile."
msgstr "Baseret på antallet af rækker i alle RRA'er og antallet af valgte konsolideringsfunktioner, størrelsen på hele denne i RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "New Profile RRA"
msgstr "Ny profil-RRA"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Aggregation Level"
msgstr "Aggregeringsniveau"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The number of samples required prior to filling a row in the RRA specification.  The first RRA should always have a value of 1."
msgstr "Antallet af prøver, der kræves, før en række i RRA-specifikationen udfyldes.  Den første RRA skal altid have værdien 1."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many generations data is kept in the RRA."
msgstr "Hvor mange generationer data opbevares i RRA'en."

#: include/global_form.php include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Timespan"
msgstr "Standardtidsrum"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When viewing a Graph based upon the RRA in question, the default Timespan to show for that Graph."
msgstr "Det standardtidsrum, der vises for en graf baseret på den pågældende RRA."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Dataopbevaring"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Based upon the Aggregation Level, the Rows, and the Polling Interval the amount of data that will be retained in the RRA"
msgstr "Baseret på aggregeringsniveauet, rækkerne og pollingintervallet, mængden af data, der opbevares i RRA'en"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "RRA Size (in Bytes)"
msgstr "RRA-størrelse (i bytes)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Based upon the number of Rows and the number of Consolidation Functions selected, the size of this RRA in the RRDfile."
msgstr "Baseret på antallet af rækker og antallet af valgte konsolideringsfunktioner, størrelsen på denne RRA i RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A useful name for this CDEF."
msgstr "Et nyttigt navn til denne CDEF."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name of this Color."
msgstr "Navnet på denne farve."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Hex Value"
msgstr "Hex-værdi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The hex value for this color; valid range: 000000-FFFFFF."
msgstr "Hex-værdien for denne farve; gyldigt interval: 000000-FFFFFF."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Read Only"
msgstr "Skrivebeskyttet"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Any named color should be read only."
msgstr "Enhver navngiven farve bør være skrivebeskyttet."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a meaningful name for this data input method."
msgstr "Angiv et meningsfuldt navn til denne datainputmetode."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Input Type"
msgstr "Inputtype"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose the method you wish to use to collect data for this Data Input method."
msgstr "Vælg den metode, du vil bruge til at indsamle data til denne datainputmetode."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Input String"
msgstr "Inputstreng"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The data that is sent to the script, which includes the complete path to the script and input sources in &lt;&gt; brackets."
msgstr "De data, der sendes til scriptet, som omfatter den fulde sti til scriptet og inputkilder i &lt;&gt;-parenteser."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "White List Check"
msgstr "Hvidlistekontrol"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The result of the Whitespace verification check for the specific Input Method.  If the Input String changes, and the Whitelist file is not updated, Graphs will not be allowed to be created."
msgstr "Resultatet af kontrollen af mellemrumsverifikation for den specifikke inputmetode.  Hvis inputstrengen ændres, og hvidlistefilen ikke opdateres, kan der ikke oprettes grafer."

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "Field [%s]"
msgstr "Felt [%s]"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "Choose the associated field from the %s field."
msgstr "Vælg det tilknyttede felt fra feltet %s."

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "Enter a name for this %s field.  Note: If using name value pairs in your script, for example: NAME:VALUE, it is important that the name match your output field name identically to the script output name or names."
msgstr "Angiv et navn til dette %s-felt.  Bemærk: Hvis du bruger navn/værdi-par i dit script, for eksempel NAME:VALUE, er det vigtigt, at navnet matcher dit outputfeltnavn identisk med scriptets outputnavn eller -navne."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Friendly Name"
msgstr "Visningsnavn"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Update RRDfile"
msgstr "Opdater RRDfile"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Whether data from this output field is to be entered into the RRDfile."
msgstr "Om data fra dette outputfelt skal indføres i RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Regular Expression Match"
msgstr "Match med regulært udtryk"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If you want to require a certain regular expression to be matched against input data, enter it here (preg_match format)."
msgstr "Hvis du vil kræve, at et bestemt regulært udtryk matches mod inputdata, skal du angive det her (preg_match-format)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Allow Empty Input"
msgstr "Tillad tomt input"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check here if you want to allow NULL input in this field from the user."
msgstr "Markér her, hvis du vil tillade NULL-input i dette felt fra brugeren."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Special Type Code"
msgstr "Specialtypekode"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "If this field should be treated specially by host templates, indicate so here. Valid keywords for this field are %s"
msgstr "Hvis dette felt skal behandles specielt af værtsskabeloner, skal du angive det her. Gyldige nøgleord for dette felt er %s"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name given to this data template."
msgstr "Navnet på denne dataskabelon."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose a name for this data source.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Kadupul documentation."
msgstr "Vælg et navn til denne datakilde.  Det kan indeholde erstatningsvariabler som |host_description| eller |query_fieldName|.  For en komplet liste over understøttede erstatningstags, se Kadupul-dokumentationen."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Source Path"
msgstr "Datakildesti"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The full path to the RRDfile."
msgstr "Den fulde sti til RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The script/source used to gather data for this data source."
msgstr "Scriptet/kilden, der bruges til at indsamle data til denne datakilde."

#: include/global_form.php package_import.php
msgid "Select the Data Source Profile.  The Data Source Profile controls polling interval, the data aggregation, and retention policy for the resulting Data Sources."
msgstr "Vælg datakildeprofilen.  Datakildeprofilen styrer pollinginterval, dataaggregering og opbevaringspolitik for de resulterende datakilder."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The amount of time in seconds between expected updates."
msgstr "Tiden i sekunder mellem forventede opdateringer."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Source Active"
msgstr "Datakilde aktiv"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Whether Kadupul should gather data for this data source or not."
msgstr "Om Kadupul skal indsamle data til denne datakilde eller ej."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Internal Data Source Name"
msgstr "Internt datakildenavn"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose a unique name to represent this piece of data inside of the RRDfile."
msgstr "Vælg et unikt navn, der repræsenterer dette stykke data i RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Minimum Value (\"U\" for No Minimum)"
msgstr "Minimumsværdi (\"U\" for intet minimum)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum value of data that is allowed to be collected."
msgstr "Den mindste dataværdi, der må indsamles."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Maximum Value (\"U\" for No Maximum)"
msgstr "Maksimumsværdi (\"U\" for intet maksimum)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum value of data that is allowed to be collected."
msgstr "Den største dataværdi, der må indsamles."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Source Type"
msgstr "Datakildetype"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data is represented in the RRA."
msgstr "Hvordan data repræsenteres i RRA'en."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time that can pass before data is entered as 'unknown'. (Usually 2x300=600)"
msgstr "Den maksimale tid, der kan gå, før data indføres som 'ukendt'. (Normalt 2x300=600)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Output Field"
msgstr "Outputfelt"

#: include/global_form.php lib/html_utility.php
msgid "Not Selected"
msgstr "Ikke valgt"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When data is gathered, the data for this field will be put into this data source."
msgstr "Når data indsamles, placeres dataene for dette felt i denne datakilde."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this GPRINT preset, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Angiv et navn til denne GPRINT-forudindstilling, og sørg for, at det er noget, du kan genkende."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Text"
msgstr "GPRINT-tekst"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter the custom GPRINT string here."
msgstr "Angiv den brugerdefinerede GPRINT-streng her."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Common Options"
msgstr "Almindelige indstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Title (--title)"
msgstr "Titel (--title)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name that is printed on the graph.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Kadupul documentation."
msgstr "Navnet, der udskrives på grafen.  Det kan indeholde erstatningsvariabler som |host_description| eller |query_fieldName|.  For en komplet liste over understøttede erstatningstags, se Kadupul-dokumentationen."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label (--vertical-label)"
msgstr "Lodret etiket (--vertical-label)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label vertically printed to the left of the graph."
msgstr "Etiketten, der udskrives lodret til venstre for grafen."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Image Format (--imgformat)"
msgstr "Billedformat (--imgformat)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of graph that is generated; PNG, GIF or SVG.  The selection of graph image type is very RRDtool dependent."
msgstr "Typen af graf, der genereres; PNG, GIF eller SVG.  Valget af grafbilledtype afhænger i høj grad af RRDtool."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Height (--height)"
msgstr "Højde (--height)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The height (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Højden (i pixel) af grafområdet i grafen. Dette område omfatter ikke signaturen, aksesignaturer eller titlen."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Width (--width)"
msgstr "Bredde (--width)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Bredden (i pixel) af grafområdet i grafen. Dette område omfatter ikke signaturen, aksesignaturer eller titlen."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Base Value (--base)"
msgstr "Basisværdi (--base)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Should be set to 1024 for memory and 1000 for traffic measurements."
msgstr "Bør sættes til 1024 for hukommelse og 1000 for trafikmålinger."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Slope Mode (--slope-mode)"
msgstr "Hældningstilstand (--slope-mode)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Brug af hældningstilstand udjævner grafernes form på bekostning af noget skærmopløsning."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Skaleringsindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Automatisk skalering"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When enabled, the selected Auto Scale Option determines which limits RRDtool uses: --alt-autoscale ignores both limits, --alt-autoscale-max keeps the lower limit, --alt-autoscale-min keeps the upper limit, and --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits) keeps both limits. When disabled, the configured lower and upper limits are used directly. Rigid Boundaries controls whether values outside those limits expand the graph range."
msgstr "Når aktiveret, bestemmer den valgte indstilling for automatisk skalering, hvilke grænser RRDtool bruger: --alt-autoscale ignorerer begge grænser, --alt-autoscale-max beholder den nedre grænse, --alt-autoscale-min beholder den øvre grænse, og --alt-autoscale (accepterer begge grænser) beholder begge grænser. Når deaktiveret, bruges de konfigurerede nedre og øvre grænser direkte. Stive grænser styrer, om værdier uden for disse grænser udvider grafens interval."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Indstillinger for automatisk skalering"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Brug <br> --alt-autoscale til at skalere til det absolutte minimum og maksimum <br> --alt-autoscale-max til at skalere til maksimumværdien med en given nedre grænse <br> --alt-autoscale-min til at skalere til minimumværdien med en given øvre grænse <br> --alt-autoscale (med grænser) til at skalere med både nedre og øvre grænse (RRDtool-standard) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Brug --alt-autoscale (ignorerer angivne grænser)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Brug --alt-autoscale-max (accepterer en nedre grænse)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Brug --alt-autoscale-min (accepterer en øvre grænse)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Brug --alt-autoscale (accepterer begge grænser, RRDtool-standard)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Logaritmisk skalering (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Brug logaritmisk skalering af y-aksen"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "SI-enheder til logaritmisk skalering (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Brug SI-enheder til logaritmisk skalering i stedet for eksponentiel notation.<br> Bemærk: Lineære grafer bruger som standard SI-notation."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Tilstand med faste grænser (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Udvid ikke den nedre og øvre grænse, hvis grafen indeholder en værdi uden for det gyldige interval."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Øvre grænse (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Den maksimale lodrette værdi for grafen."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Nedre grænse (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Den minimale lodrette værdi for grafen."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Gitterindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Enhedsgitterværdi (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Angiver eksponentværdien på Y-aksen for tal. Bemærk: Denne indstilling er forældet og erstattet af indstillingen --y-grid.  Med denne indstilling vises Y-aksens gitterlinjer ved hvert gitterintervaltrin.  Etiketter placeres for hver etiketfaktor-linje."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Enhedseksponentværdi (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Kadupul should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Hvilken enhed Kadupul skal bruge på Y-aksen. Brug 3 til at vise alt i \"k\" eller -6 til at vise alt i \"u\" (mikro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Enhedslængde (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Hvor mange cifre skal RRDtool antage, at y-aksens etiketter har? Du skal muligvis bruge denne indstilling for at skabe nok plads, når du begynder at justere y-aksens etikettering."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Ingen gittertilpasning (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "For at undgå sløringseffekter fra anti-aliasing fastlåser RRDtool punkter til enhedens opløsningspixels, hvilket giver et skarpere udseende. Hvis det ikke falder i din smag, kan du bruge denne indstilling til at slå denne adfærd fra.<br><strong>Bemærk: </strong>Gittertilpasning er som standard slået fra for PDF-, EPS- og SVG-output."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Alternativt Y-gitter (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Algoritmen sikrer, at du altid har et gitter, at der er nok, men ikke for mange gitterlinjer, og at gitteret er metrisk. Denne parameter sikrer også, at der vises nok decimaler, selv om din graf går fra 69,998 til 70,001.<br><strong>Bemærk: </strong>Denne parameter kan komme i konflikt med indstillingerne for --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Akseindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Højre akse (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "En anden akse tegnes til højre for grafen. Den er knyttet til venstre akse via parametrene scale og shift."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Etiket for højre akse (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Etiketten for højre akse."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Format for højre akse (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Som standard bestemmes formatet på akseetiketterne automatisk.  Hvis du selv vil bestemme det, så brug denne indstilling med de samme %lf-argumenter, som du kender fra kommandoerne PRINT og GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Formatering af højre akse (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you set up the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Når du opsætter etikettering af højre akse, anvendes en regel på dataformatet.  Understøttede formater omfatter \"numeric\", hvor data behandles som tal, \"timestamp\", hvor værdier fortolkes som UNIX-tidsstempler (antal sekunder siden januar 1970) og udtrykkes med strftime-format (standard er \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Se også --units-length og --right-axis-format.  Endelig \"duration\", hvor værdier fortolkes som varighed i millisekunder.  Formateringen følger reglerne for valstrfduration-kvalificeret PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Formatering af venstre akse (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you set up the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Når du opsætter etikettering af venstre akse, anvendes en regel på dataformatet.  Understøttede formater omfatter \"numeric\", hvor data behandles som tal, \"timestamp\", hvor værdier fortolkes som UNIX-tidsstempler (antal sekunder siden januar 1970) og udtrykkes med strftime-format (standard er \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Se også --units-length.  Endelig \"duration\", hvor værdier fortolkes som varighed i millisekunder.  Formateringen følger reglerne for valstrfduration-kvalificeret PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Indstillinger for signaturforklaring"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Automatisk udfyldning"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Udfyld tekst, så signaturforklaring og grafdata altid flugter. Bemærk: Dette kan medføre, at det tager længere tid at tegne graferne på grund af den større belastning. Automatisk udfyldning er desuden ikke nøjagtig på alle typer grafer; ensartet etikettering hjælper normalt."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
