msgid "Enables Gradient Support for AREA and STACK charts."
msgstr "Aktiverer understøttelse af gradienter for AREA- og STACK-diagrammer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Metode til graftilladelser"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph access is granted directly by a graph permission in every mode. Permissive also grants access when the user has permission for the graph's device or template. Restrictive requires permission for both the device and template when there is no direct graph permission. Device Based requires device permission, and Graph Template Based requires template permission. User and group policies are evaluated separately and their allowed results are combined. These modes trade query performance against fine-grained permissions on large installations."
msgstr "Adgang til grafer gives direkte af en graftilladelse i alle tilstande. Tilladende giver også adgang, når brugeren har tilladelse til grafens enhed eller skabelon. Restriktiv kræver tilladelse til både enheden og skabelonen, når der ikke er en direkte graftilladelse. Enhedsbaseret kræver enhedstilladelse, og Grafskabelonbaseret kræver skabelontilladelse. Bruger- og gruppepolitikker evalueres hver for sig, og deres tilladte resultater kombineres. Disse tilstande afvejer forespørgselsydeevne mod finkornede tilladelser i store installationer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Tilladende"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Restriktiv"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Enhedsbaseret"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Metode til oprettelse af grafer/datakilder"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Hvis sat til Enkel, kan grafer og datakilder kun oprettes fra Nye grafer.  Hvis Avanceret, understøttes den ældre oprettelse af grafer og datakilder."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Enkel"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanceret"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Vis formular-/indstillingshjælp indlejret"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be shown inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Når afkrydset, vises formular- og indstillingshjælp indlejret.  Ellers vises den, når du holder markøren over hjælpeknappen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Kun lokal sidehjælp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Kadupul page help is located at kadupul.org.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of your Kadupul server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Som standard findes Kadupuls sidehjælp på kadupul.org.  Hvis dit system dog ikke har adgang til internettet, kan du downloade dokumentationen lokalt i HTML-format og hoste den i 'docs'-placeringen på din Kadupul-server.  Hvis du kun vil bruge den lokale placering til sidehjælpsdokumentationen, så afkryds dette felt."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Bekræftelse af sletning"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Spørg brugeren før sletning af et element."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Forvalg for bevarelse af datakilder"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Kadupul will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Når aktiveret, sætter Kadupul alternativknappen til at slette en grafs tilknyttede datakilder, når grafer fjernes.  Bemærk: Kadupul tillader ikke fjernelse af datakilder, hvis de bruges i andre grafer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Automatisk oplåsning af grafer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will not lock Graphs.  This allows a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Når aktiveret, låser Kadupul ikke grafer.  Det giver hurtigere manuel ændring af datakilder, der hører til en graf."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Kadupul Dashboard"
msgstr "Skjul Kadupul-dashboardet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Kadupul's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Kadupul Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Til brug sammen med Kadupuls understøttelse af eksterne links.  Med denne indstilling kan du skjule Kadupul-dashboardet, så du kun viser din egen side."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Aktivér træk og slip"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Kadupul's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired users, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Nogle af Kadupuls grænseflader understøtter træk og slip.  Hvis afkrydset, aktiveres denne funktion.  Bemærk: For synshandicappede brugere kan denne indstilling deaktiveres."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Webstedssikkerhed"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Gennemtving forbindelser over HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Kadupul will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Når afkrydset, omdirigeres alle forsøg på at tilgå Kadupul til HTTPS for at sikre høj sikkerhed."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Tillad usikker HTTPS til fjerndataindsamler"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Tillad brug af selvsignerede certifikater, og tillad, at certifikatets værtsnavn afviger fra fjerndataindsamlerens."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Tillad usikre metategn i datainputmetoder"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Kadupul administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Kadupul Graphs.  In earlier versions of Kadupul, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Kadupul, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Kadupul restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Kadupul continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Historisk set oprettede Kadupul-administratorer simple datainputmetoder med kommandoer som \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" til at repræsentere en numerisk værdi til brug i Kadupul-grafer.  I tidligere versioner af Kadupul var dette tilladt.  Det er dog en usikker praksis, da det er en indgang for tredjepartsbrugere til at udgive usikre dataskabeloner.  I moderne Kadupul bør sådanne fremgangsmåder undgås.  Vi tilbyder dog denne indstilling, hvis du har ældre datainputmetoder, der indeholder disse usikre metategn, og ikke har konverteret dem til lokale scripts i mappen 'scripts'.  Når denne indstilling ikke er afkrydset, begrænser Kadupul shell-lignende metategn som anførselstegn, tuborgparenteser, lodrette streger, omvendte skråstreger og backticks.  Kadupul tillader fortsat større-end- og mindre-end-tegn til f.eks. <path_cacti> og til inputparametre, men hvis denne indstilling ikke er afkrydset, er det grænsen for deres tilladte brug."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Content-Security-scriptpolitik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy. The Nonce Mode - Reporting Only choice reports inline scripts that lack a nonce without blocking them. The implementation also supports an enforcing nonce mode through direct configuration, but this mode is not offered here because many built-in pages and plugins still use inline scripts without nonces. Enabling enforcement before those scripts are migrated can break pages and plugins. Use CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute() when adding inline scripts."
msgstr "Styrer CSP-politikken script-src. Valget Nonce-tilstand - kun rapportering rapporterer indlejrede scripts uden nonce uden at blokere dem. Implementeringen understøtter også en håndhævende nonce-tilstand via direkte konfiguration, men denne tilstand tilbydes ikke her, fordi mange indbyggede sider og plugins stadig bruger indlejrede scripts uden nonces. Hvis håndhævelse aktiveres, før disse scripts er migreret, kan sider og plugins gå i stykker. Brug CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute(), når du tilføjer indlejrede scripts."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Tillad indlejret JavaScript uden nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Tillad både unsafe-eval og indlejret JavaScript uden nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Nonce-tilstand - kun rapportering"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI til CSP-overtrædelsesrapporter"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL, hvortil browsere POST'er CSP-overtrædelsesrapporter i tilstandene nonce-report og nonce. Lad feltet være tomt for at bruge <url_path>/csp_report.php. Må kun indeholde sikre URL-tegn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Alternative kilder til Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Mellemrumsseparerede domænenavne, som må tilgås uden for selve webserveren.  Det er vigtigt for brugere, der vælger at bruge et CDN eller en hostingtjeneste.  Kilder kan indeholde jokertegn, f.eks.: *.mydomain.com, eller en protokol, f.eks.: https://*.example.com.  Disse alternative kilder omfatter kun billed-, CSS- og JavaScript-typer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL, hvortil browsere POST'er CSP-overtrædelsesrapporter i tilstandene nonce-report og nonce. Lad feltet være tomt for at bruge /cacti/csp_report.php i installationsroden. Må kun indeholde sikre URL-tegn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Aktivér automatisk grafoprettelse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Når deaktiveret, opretter Kadupul Automation ikke aktivt nogen grafer.  Det er nyttigt, når du justerer enhedsindstillinger, så du undgår at oprette nye grafer, hver gang du gemmer et objekt.  Det vil stadig være muligt at køre automatiseringsregler manuelt."

