msgid "Once installation has completed, the CSRF path should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Når installationen er afsluttet, bør CSRF-stien angives til skrivebeskyttet."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Alle mapper er skrivbare"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "RRDfile Locations"
msgstr "RRDfile-placeringer"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Data Source paths could not be read, so RRDfile locations were not checked. Check them after the upgrade with the poller log."
msgstr "Datakildestierne kunne ikke læses, så RRDfile-placeringer blev ikke kontrolleret. Kontrollér dem efter opgraderingen med poller-loggen."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Every Data Source RRDfile path is inside an allowed directory"
msgstr "Alle datakilders RRDfile-stier ligger i en tilladt mappe"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Data Sources have an RRDfile path outside the RRA directory. This version only creates and updates RRDfiles inside the RRA directory or a directory listed in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] in include/config.php, so these Data Sources will stop updating until one of the following is done:"
msgstr "%d datakilder har en RRDfile-sti uden for RRA-mappen. Denne version opretter og opdaterer kun RRDfiles i RRA-mappen eller en mappe, der er angivet i $config['rrd_additional_paths'] i include/config.php, så disse datakilder holder op med at opdatere, indtil et af følgende er gjort:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "List the directory that holds them in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] in include/config.php, for example $config['rrd_additional_paths'] = array('/data/rrd');"
msgstr "Angiv den mappe, der indeholder dem, i $config['rrd_additional_paths'] i include/config.php, for eksempel $config['rrd_additional_paths'] = array('/data/rrd');"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Or move them into the RRA directory with structure_rra_paths.php --proceed: stop the poller, list their directory in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] so the script accepts them, run it, then remove the entry. Do not move them by hand and clear the Data Source Path, which starts a new, empty RRDfile."
msgstr "Eller flyt dem til RRA-mappen med structure_rra_paths.php --proceed: stop polleren, angiv deres mappe i $config['rrd_additional_paths'], så scriptet accepterer dem, kør det, og fjern derefter posten. Flyt dem ikke manuelt og ryd datakildestien, da det starter en ny, tom RRDfile."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "and %d more"
msgstr "og %d flere"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "DATA SOURCES:"
msgstr "DATAKILDER:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "See docs/rrd-path-containment.md for details."
msgstr "Se docs/rrd-path-containment.md for flere detaljer."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Hvidlistebeskyttelse af inputvalidering"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Kadupul Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Kadupul poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Kadupuls datainputmetoder, der kalder et script, kan udnyttes på måder, hvor en ikke-administrator kan ødelægge filer, der ejes af pollerkontoen, og hvor en person kører Kadupul-polleren som root, kan kompromittere operativsystemet og give angribere mulighed for at udnytte din infrastruktur."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Kadupul was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Kadupul more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Kadupul administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Derfor blev Kadupul for flere versioner siden udvidet med hvidlistefunktioner for denne type datainputmetoder.  Selvom dette sikrer Kadupul mere grundigt, øger det den mængde arbejde, som Kadupul-administratoren skal udføre for at importere og administrere skabeloner og pakker."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and/or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Hvidlisten fungerer sådan, at når du første gang importerer en datainputmetode eller importerer den igen, og scriptet og/eller argumenterne ændres på nogen måde, deaktiveres datainputmetoden og alle de tilhørende datakilder straks, indtil administratoren har bekræftet, at datainputmetoden er gyldig."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state easier, we have provided a validation script in Kadupul's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "For at gøre det lettere at finde datainputmetoder i denne tilstand har vi lavet et valideringsscript i Kadupuls CLI-mappe, som kan køres med følgende indstillinger:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Denne scriptindstilling søger efter datainputmetoder, der aktuelt er spærret, og giver detaljer om årsagen."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Denne scriptindstilling ophæver spærringen af de datainputmetoder, der aktuelt er spærret."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Denne scriptindstilling genaktiverer alle deaktiverede datakilder."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "Det anbefales kraftigt, at du opdaterer din config.php for at aktivere denne funktion ved at fjerne kommentartegnet fra variablen <b>$input_whitelist</b> og derefter køre de tre CLI-scriptindstillinger ovenfor, når den webbaserede installation er afsluttet."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Markér afkrydsningsfeltet nedenfor for at bekræfte, at du har læst og forstået denne sikkerhedsbekymring"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Jeg har læst denne erklæring"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Standardprofil"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources.  This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Kadupul Server host.  Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Vælg den standarddatakildeprofil, der skal bruges til polling af kilder.  Dette er den maksimale tid mellem scanninger af enheder for oplysninger, så jo lavere polling-intervallet er, desto mere arbejde lægges der på Kadupul-serverværten.  Vælg også det tilsigtede eller konfigurerede cron-interval, du ønsker at bruge til dataindsamling."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Cron-interval"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Standardautomatiseringsnetværk"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Kadupul can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Kadupul kan automatisk scanne netværket, når installationen er afsluttet. Dette bruger netværksområdet nedenfor til at udregne det område af IP-adresser, der kan scannes.  Der er defineret et foruddefineret sæt indstillinger til scanning, som omfatter brug af både 'public'- og 'private'-communities."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Hvis dine enheder kræver et andet sæt indstillinger først, kan du definere dem nedenfor, og de bruges før standardindstillingerne"

